cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the MathTEC-Bench benchmark, please cite the dataset/code repository (this entry) and the paper below."
title: "MathCorrector: QLoRA specialization of Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct for mathematical text error correction"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, benchmark splits, prediction files and evaluation scripts for MathCorrector, a QLoRA-fine-tuned Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct model that minimally repairs terminology, notation, formula and logical errors in English mathematical text interleaved with LaTeX.
